                <div dir="ltr" class=""><font class="" face="arial,
                    helvetica, sans-serif">This is the working group
                    last call for the "TLS 1.3 Extension for
                    Certificate-based Authentication with an External
                    Pre-Shared Key” draft available at <a
href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-cert-with-extern-psk/"
                      target="_blank" moz-do-not-send="true" class="">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-cert-with-extern-psk/</a>.
                    Please review the document and send your comments to
